---
import Navbar from "../../../../components/Navbar.astro";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>软件生态 — Linxira OS</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0E1417; color: #e5e7eb; line-height: 1.8; }

    .layout { display: flex; padding-top: 60px; min-height: 100vh; }
    .sidebar { width: 260px; background: #0c1322; border-right: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); padding: 2rem 0; position: fixed; top: 60px; bottom: 0; overflow-y: auto; }
    .sidebar-title { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 0 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .sidebar a { display: block; padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: all 0.2s; border-left: 3px solid transparent; }
    .sidebar a:hover { color: #20B8B0; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.05); }
    .sidebar a.active { color: #20B8B0; border-left-color: #20B8B0; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.08); }
    .sidebar .section { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

    .main { flex: 1; margin-left: 260px; padding: 3rem 4rem; max-width: 1000px; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20B8B0, #F36F5D); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; color: #e2e8f0; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.8rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); }
    p { color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    a { color: #20B8B0; }
    code { background: rgba(30,41,59,0.8); padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #20B8B0; }

    .app-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem; }
    .app-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s; }
    .app-card:hover { border-color: rgba(32,184,176,0.4); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .app-card h3 { color: #20B8B0; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .app-card .pkg { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .app-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .app-card .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; background: rgba(32,184,176,0.15); color: #20B8B0; padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0.15rem 0.2rem 0 0; }
    .app-card .tag.rec { background: rgba(243,111,93,0.2); color: #F36F5D; }
    .app-card .tag.prop { background: rgba(243,111,93,0.12); color: #fca5a5; }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 2rem; color: #475569; font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.3); margin-left: 260px; }
    @media (max-width: 768px) { .sidebar { display: none; } .main { margin-left: 0; padding: 2rem; } footer { margin-left: 0; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <Navbar lang="zh" active="docs" />

  <div class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">开始</div>
        <a href="/zh/docs/">概述</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/install/">安装指南</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/quick-start/">快速开始</a>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">用户指南</div>
        <a href="/zh/docs/package-managers/">包管理器</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/ecosystem/" class="active">软件生态</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/apps/">官方软件</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/config-hub/">配置中心</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/remote-access/">远程访问（SSH）</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/desktop/">桌面环境</a>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">开发者</div>
        <a href="/zh/docs/contributing/">参与贡献</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/building/">构建 ISO</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/repository-structure/">仓库结构</a>
      </div>
      <div class="section">
        <div class="sidebar-title">参考</div>
        <a href="/zh/legal/license/">开源协议</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/glossary/">术语表</a>
        <a href="/zh/docs/faq/">常见问题</a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main">
      <a href="/zh/docs/" style="color:#20B8B0; text-decoration:none; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">← 返回文档</a>
      <h1>软件生态</h1>
      <p>Linxira OS 的软件生态由 <strong>93 个精选应用</strong>组成，按 14 个分类组织，全部通过 <strong>catalog v3 审查流程</strong>（许可证/来源/可用性分级）。可用应用通过 <code>pacman</code> 从官方签名仓库 <a href="https://linxira-os.github.io/linxira-packages/x86_64" target="_blank">[linxira]</a> 安装；带 <span class="tag rec">推荐</span> 标记的是官方推荐的常用应用，<span class="tag prop">专有</span> 标记表示专有软件（安装时需接受其许可协议）。</p>
      <h2>网络与浏览器 <span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:400;">(4)</span></h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Firefox 浏览器</h3>
          <div class="pkg">firefox</div>
          <p>注重隐私的通用网页浏览器。</p>
          <span class="tag rec">推荐</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Chromium 浏览器</h3>
          <div class="pkg">chromium</div>
          <p>开源 Chromium 网页浏览器。</p>
          <span class="tag rec">推荐</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Brave 浏览器</h3>
          <div class="pkg">brave-bin</div>
          <p>第三方 Chromium 系浏览器候选。</p>
          <span class="tag rec">推荐</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Nyxt</h3>
          <div class="pkg">nyxt</div>
          <p>可编程的极客浏览器。</p>
          
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>邮件与通信 <span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:400;">(6)</span></h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Thunderbird 邮件</h3>
          <div class="pkg">thunderbird</div>
          <p>邮件、日历与联系人客户端。</p>
          <span class="tag rec">推荐</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Element</h3>
          <div class="pkg">element-desktop</div>
          <p>Matrix 通信客户端。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Telegram Desktop</h3>
          <div class="pkg">telegram-desktop</div>
          <p>Telegram 消息桌面客户端。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Signal Desktop</h3>
          <div class="pkg">signal-desktop</div>
          <p>Signal 加密通信桌面客户端。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Neochat</h3>
          <div class="pkg">neochat</div>
          <p>Matrix 协议聊天客户端。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Fractal</h3>
          <div class="pkg">fractal</div>
          <p>GNOME Matrix 聊天客户端。</p>
          
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2>办公 <span style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#64748b;font-weight:400;">(4)</span></h2>
      <div class="app-grid">
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>LibreOffice</h3>
          <div class="pkg">libreoffice-fresh</div>
          <p>用于文档、表格和演示的开放办公套件。</p>
          <span class="tag rec">推荐</span>
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Calligra 套件</h3>
          <div class="pkg">calligra</div>
          <p>KDE 办公与图形套件。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>ONLYOFFICE 桌面编辑器</h3>
