        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Evince</h3>
          <div class="pkg">evince</div>
          <p>GNOME 文档阅读器，PDF/漫画/Djvu。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Zathura</h3>
          <div class="pkg">zathura</div>
          <p>极简键盘驱动的 PDF 阅读器。</p>
          
        </div>
        <div class="app-card">
          <h3>Ghostwriter</h3>
          <div class="pkg">ghostwriter</div>
          <p>无干扰 Markdown 编辑器。</p>
          
